# Phase 212 (D-04, D-10): code-owner review on the check, the engine pin and the trust list.
#
# These paths define what the PR check runs (/.github/), which engine it trusts (the pin
# .okf/engine.lock) and who may approve a trusted-review sign-off (.okf/maintainers), all under
# /.okf/. A change to any of them needs a code owner's review.
#
# Set up once: replace the owner token @guyernest with this repository's maintainer team
# or user, then turn on "Require review from Code Owners" in the branch ruleset for the default
# branch (see the CI runbook). Until both are done this file protects nothing.
/.github/ @guyernest
/.okf/ @guyernest
/.claude/ @guyernest
/scripts/ @guyernest
